In its latest report, the International Agency for Nuclear-Energy (IAEA) pointed out that everything indicates that Iran did not put an attempt to obtain nuclear weapons.
Possible attack on nuclear facilities in Iran was discussed in Israel.
Tuesday at noon, the prayers of the students before entering the Isfahan Uranium Entity Plant was followed by a prayer for the death of both the United States and Israel.
In the event of an attack aimed at maximally paralsiling of the Iranian nuclear program, goals will be, according to the Israeli press, installations in both Isfahan and Nathanza, where uranium enrichment is carried out.
Meals of obescious children: No breakfast or sausage
More than a third of children between the ages of 9 or the age of 13 weigh more than the norm; while 9% of schoolchildren are overweight, and 5 per cent suffer from obescence.
According to the latest study, children suffering from obescren't usually come from unhealthy families.
We once again see the importance of the environment and patterns of behavior accompanying a person, for him or its healthy development.
For example, sausage appears on the tables of children suffering from obescence, almost twice as often as in families with children who have a normal weight.
More than 19% of children suffering from obescence renounced French potatoes for dinner on the eve of a survey referring to an educational event called Obesity is no coincidence.
Moreover, the families of children suffering from obescence are not engaged in sports. This, however, applies to the majority of families of modern schoolchildren - only 15% of children said that their parents find the time to play sports at least once a week.
The study was carried out among 900 children.
The study was carried out at the end of the last academic year; it was attended by almost 900 pupils of elementary classes throughout Bohemia.
Obesity is not an accident for the second year in a row, with the support of the insurance company Všeobecná zdravotní pojišťovna and Unilever.
To date, more than 12 thousand pupils-student students of grades have joined the project.
Correct nutrition and sufficient sports load are the main determinants, causing a rapidly growing number of children who are suffering either from excessive weight or from obesity.
“For example, only half of the respondents said that they ate five times a day, according to the scheme of a breakfast-snack-cervical snus, but this is one of the indispensable conditions of proper nutrition,” according to one of the conclusions of the study.
No lunch or sausage
Experts warn that for a healthy development, even such relative details are important, as the constant time of a family breakfast.
In the Czech Republic, only 23% of schoolbular families vacanize breakfast together.
In the majority of families, everyone has breakfast individually.
The worst discovery was that in every tenth of a family, people do not have breakfast at all.
And yet breakfast is the basis of the correct daily vegetation.
The study showed that fried food is more often used in families with children suffering from Obesity.
Almost everyone - regardless of weight - dries sweet soft drinks every day (70%).
Although more than 40% of the children are regularly engaged in sports, this figure decreases by more than half - up to 15% - when it comes to their parents.
Create your own menu.
In another part of the study to selected children (204 boys and 172 girls out of 13 schools), it was proposed to compile their own menus, based on the proposed products, and based on their tastes and precursions.
Preferences in meal in Czech children aged 12-15 years are far from the ideal in terms of a healthy meal."
Their favorite food includes a large number of terrifying, measles and sweet dishes.
“Special announ is the great popularity of sugary soft drinks”, according to the final part of the study.
As the main dining meal of the paste defeated the poultior with a small preliminary period.
However, the children practically did not show an interest in beans, fish and vegetable meals.
Desire for a Healthy Lifestyle
The study also showed that the children are ready to change their eating habits, provided they will be provided with relevant information.
“Many participants in the control group of the study showed a significant shift in preferences towards healthy food, when filling out a questionnaire after the completion of an Obesity Lectur – it is not an accident,” according to the results of the project.
This was especially noticeable, for example, in the case of sleeving soft drinks - more children began to prefer just water.
In addition, as the main medlow, the children often noted poultry and fish, limiting the number of sweet meals and brewing.
Stylist should also be a good co-psychiatrist, says professionals
In the first article about the stylist trainings I complained about the amount of information in introductory classes.
I didn't know what's going to happen.
Lecturies of three experts in this field, tips for choosing clothes for non-standard figures; and a seminar on how it all works in real life.
Then there's a lot more.
the closer we are to the final exam, the more information and practical tasks awaits us.
The training takes place every Saturday and Sunday, but it’s really saturated with information.
This time with Alynka, the director (there is not a single man at the course), we talked about how to dress a woman whose body is not perfectly symcitating.
Most women aren’t symmetry.
One has a laryngeal neck, the other has a guineantal figure without proper shape, another weighs more than the norm.
The stylist should know how to visually reduce wide shoulders, elongate the neck, or add missing volumes.
We were given tips, how to emphasize the figure of such women as Jennifer López, i.e. the owners of a lush chest and hip and narrow waist, and at the same same time do not dress too provocative.
For example, if the difference in waist and hip volume is so large that you can not choose a skirt or trousers, it is necessary to have at least one thing sewn to order.
You clearly do not regret the invested, since perfectly sitting clothes are invaluable.
In the skirt, sewn to order, you will feel much much better than in the one that constantly moves, rolls, exposes the waist, etc.
Holders of boyish figures, on the other hand, can wear clothes with piles, applications, embroidery or folds.
Given the plenti of such information and types of figures, I am delighted that I have a whole of a week to realize all this.
And yet, I'm afraid, that's too much, considering the homework we've got.
Each participant of the courses needed to come up with two outfit for any celebrity: for a day and for an evening.
We need to take into account their modern appearance, their style in clothes and the type of figure.
I have to dress Miranda Kerr, which you can know about Victoria's Secret advertising campaigns.
I rejoice about myself, because it is much easier to dress than, say, Brittney Spears, Kristina Aguilera, who has recently recovered by a ton (please, keep in mind what I exaggerate), or a very young Selena Gómez.
We have to trim clothes from the logs or find it on the Internet, print and process it using graphical programs.
Mudbord - the so-called result of the work - then reflects our own style and the attitude to the graphic image.
It’s important to keep a graphical component of style in your head.
The stylist doesn't just dress real people, but creates grocery pages in magazines (based on special instructions, for example, junkies, coats, etc.).
That’s what stylist and designer Mario Kamenick told us.
But this was only on Sunday.
Stylists need general knowledge
The Saturday lecture, saturated with information about the types of figures, revived three guests - specialists in this field.
Stylist, Honza Pokorny; fashion designer, Jakub Polanka; and fashion photographer Ben Rench.
Yakub reminded us that fashion is an illusion and a stylist should use this fact.
A good stylist knows how to use a single garment in different ways.
In this case, the diversity is the key to success.
For example, coat-trench can be worn in the usual manner, on top of jeans and t-shirts like a coat; but it can also be worn on a bare body, without clasping like a dress.
Another possibility - to roll up the sleeves or raise the collar, and the entire image is completely changed.
“Please play with him,” he said.
In any case, I most appreciated the following advice: “For your work, you need to have a perfect knowledge of the rules.”
Then you can start to break them,” Jakub told us.
Here I have finally understood why we cramse all the definitions and rules, what to combine with and why, whereas in fashion magazines we often see quite something else.
Don't mention fashion shows.
From Ben, photographer, I've figured out a stylist have to have more outfits than the number of pictures he needs to take.
So, for a vocabulary on ten pages (equivalent to ten outskirts), I have to be ready to create at least fifteen images.
Now I also know that the garment in the picture often looks and works in combination with others not at the same way as in reality.
We need to keep this in mind when we create an image.
Honza Pokorna confirmed that often the image and the style - half the success.
Just take a look at Madonna who doesn't have astounding vocals, but her image and marketing have turned her into a world star.
Attachment to stylist services in the Czech Republic - is still quite cool.
Even well-known people often consider it superfluous (and believe that it is enough to be an expert in something, and what they look secondary).
And if someone finally lets us create their style, we have to expect them to give us another (Little) size than the one that they really wear.
Then we turn to Google and find out whether the tabloids have written something that some celebrity is fat/swebstuated, etc.
On Sunday, Honza and Mario emphasized that it is not enough for a stylist to understand vogue in fashion and be able to choose an outfit.
Our work mainly consists of communication with the people whom we dress; so it is important to be a good psychologist.
In order to be able to evaluate people, do not indulge them and adhere to their opinion.
“If the manager asks you to look at her clothes and add a few beautiful things, you don’t want to throw away her entire wardrobe by telling her that her clothes are horrific.”
“Find at least a few things that you can plorify, and advise you that you can wear with them,” says Mario.
It has also shown us what the workbage bag has to be placed specifically.
It’s the bag you taunt around the waist to carry everything you need.
In addition to obvious things, such as screeched scissors, sticky roller or English pins, it should have a nylon stitushion (the stylists use it when shooting some items, such as handbbs or hats), special clips for fastening the fabric on your back in the event that the clothes are too large (plugs and similar objects are prohibited, since they spoil clothes) or a sewing set.
In order to distract from the lections and get some practical experience, we have already learned how to properly make pads on the soles of the shoes.
Even during the shooting in the studio, where the floor is smooth, the soles can get damage - not to mention the shooting on the street.
And here's what we're embossed.
You don’t have to touch your shovels with scissors so you don’t screw them.
This requires real mastery.
I was pleased that Mario praised my work.
I didn't like these skills.
This is only part of what we heard during the second part of the day-of-the-study.
I’m beginning to understand that being a professional stylist isn’t easy, no matter what they say.
V Need for Speed: Escape takes place in the United States.
Overview
What was supposed to be a carefree walk turned into a rutinous morning trip to work due to a series of completely irrelevant and negligent mistakes.
Ambitions to a certain extent were dissatisfied, but it doesn’t matter, because no one clearly wanted to do unnecessary work.
Before the release with the new version with the subtitle "Escape", there were great hopes.
It was expected that she will shift the previous series of Need For Speed in a new direction; the demonstration versions testified indicate that the game will take a worthy place in the genre of racing games.
We were curious to see part of the game, where the protagonist gets out of the car and runs.
As it often happens with NFS, in the end, a lot is different from what we expected.
The game is a fairly good arcade race, but the overall impression is spoiled by a few unnecessary mistakes, which are present in this series of games for several years.
So, in fact, this is not a mistake, but an unexplained laundry of developers.
Adventure begins very well.
You become a part of the story whose protagonist Jack decides to solve certain personal problems by participating in an illegal race through America.
You get in the car on the west coast, in San Francisco, and your task is the first to get to New York.
This idea has a number of interesting features.
The route consists of ten stages, divided into more than fifty races.
This means that each race passes along its route, individual stages take place in a diverse and interesting environment.
It doesn’t feel like it’s the same thing happening all the time.
Despite the fact that the fragrance is at the same level as in the previous parts of the series, it's nice to see some tracks.
And yet, the game does not cause strong emotions.
Although leading the car through the deer, in the autumn suburbs or high in the snow-covered mountains is very pleasant.
In addition, the race from time to time animates an unusual detail.
For example, in the desert you fall into a sandstorm, significantly reducing visibility.
On the other hand, you need to be careful in the mountains so you don't fall under the avalanche.
Separate chases are quite well ordered.
There are only a few varieties, but this is enough.
For a while, you are trying to overtook several opponents (essentially an ordinary race); then you’re trying to improve your time (a standard stopwatch race); or you’re competing with an anti-announcer.
Among other things, from time to time you stipulate from time to time the police that complicates your task.
Components outside the car are new.
It’s just an interactive animation, where most of the time Jack runs away from someone and you have to help him by clicking the right buttons at the right time.
It's nothing complicated.
Surprisingly, there’s much fewer of these fragments than you might expect (only three to be accurate).
In fact, it turns out that it’s a good thing to play, because it doesn’t get bored; given all of the above, it’s one of the things that make the game more entertaining.
The racing model follows in the footsteps of previous models.
This means that it no longer represents something special, but it can not be considered a drawbridge.
If you’re looking for imitation of a real-life, you will have to look elsewhere.
Nevertheless, this driving model is very suitable for dynamic races, although you can find better options on the market.
It's all very good so far.
However, after a certain time the problems begin.
In contrast to the driving model, the collation model isn't so good.
You don’t anticipate complex changes and clashes, but if you don’t have any idea how your car behaves, something isn’t.
Typically, overtaking or passing by cars in a dense stream, you sometimes slightly touch the other machine. And yet sometimes in a practically similar situation, your machine begins to unwind.
Or shattered in shaking.
This isn’t very important thanks to a restart system, but it’s enough to spoil the fun.
Reboots are arranged in such a way that, if you break or go far from the track, the game returns you to the point where it is interrupted.
Nevertheless, there are only five reboots available for each race.
If you’re using all of them, you will have to start the race at the very beginning.
It’s useful if something doesn’t work out, but you can’t fully reliance.
Reboots are not enough, and you have to memorize a separate section of the race by heart.
An important flaw of the game is the fact that the same things often happen in the same places.
For example, you need to pass some turns in a certain way, otherwise you simply will not fit in.
In other cases, you meet civilian cars in a certain place in the same configuration, regardless of whether you arrive first, the fifth, five seconds sooner or a minute later.
This is especially annoying in situations where you can see how your opponent easily passes between the two cars moving in the opposite direction when you find yourself there, the cars are already arranged in such a way that you need to either go around them or reset the velocity.
It doesn’t matter if you find yourself next to them; it’s all arranged in such a way that the situation always takes place just in front of your nasm.
Companions also have other advantages.
During the game, you will discover several places where, regardless of time, the same opponent overtakes you in the same place.
This is especially evident at the end of the game, on a long bridge where you’re going in the opposite direction.
Obscircularly, your opponent should stand in front of you no matter what.
The fact is that when he drives in front of you, it worsens your visibility, which leads to one or a few accidents in this precinct.
You can see an attempt to make the game more interesting and filled with adrenaline, but this is so obvious that it quickly becomes annoying.
It is a pity, because in spite of a simple model of driving, the game is entertaining and is sometimes so saturated that you don’t have time to pay attention to what is happening around you.
It doesn’t matter what makes you get bored – the concept with fifty unique tracks, a sequence of races or something else.
The idea of changing cars during the race is unusual.
You need to track the dressings along the way, since it is to them that your car can change, despite the fact that in most cases the one that you already have is quite enough.
The machines are divided into three categories.
Athletic machines are suitable for cities; powerful American cars - for direct stretches of the highway; and exotic super-sports for technical driving, for example, on curved mountain trails.
The main story mode mode is closely related to the challenge mode; it’s races on individual sites that you’ll recognize in the course of the game.
Here you are conquering for your personal business, both medals and glasses, common to challenges modes and stories.
Many possibilities are available to obtain a higher level of driving, ranging from machines to profile data.
In addition, the profile relates to an online Autolog function, which, among other things, compares the results achieved by you achieves with the results of the other players, and provides communication with the public.
Here’s another draw-off, difficult to comprehend; it’s an exemplary merchandise from the last race.
You and your car get into the subway Tunnel (we will assume that so), where you race on the rails in the darkness (we will think so).
Your speedometer shows the numbers from 150 to 200 km / h (to assume that so), when suddenly a subway train floats behind you, turning your car into a pile of scrap metal.
Within a few days, our editors discussed whether during the creation of the game did not anyone think for a second, or its creators really consider us such morons.
The technical component of the game does not represent anything special; but the general impression of a video sequence is mostly pleasant, sometimes even stunning.
Although it is a pity that in some critical moments the quality of the recording, sometimes quite strongly, decreases.
This is especially true of incidents with a large number of participants, where a good recording wouldn’t particularly help you either.
The sound is quench in quench; the soundtrack to an aviator.
To please a wide-ranquan youth audience as possible, the soundtrack “compositions from different styles” entered the soundtrack; but it is unlikely that many people will buy a game due to its music.
The General Immemorial of the Need for Speed: Escape Quite Disapproving.
If the game avoided clearly unnecessary bugs, we could sincerely say that Effort is the best NFS over the past few years.
Be that as it may, the game leaves a sense of unfinished.
Of course, this is a good entertainment, but get ready that the flaw flaws will mold you like a spotlight of an airport.
Horses of Carlov University will perform at the concert "Students in velvet"
For the third-a-a-a-a-a-a-a-day Festa Academia festival offers to merge an international student’s day and an anniversary of a velvet revolution with a music event.
He will present about twenty school choir and university choirs.
The main event of the festival - two concerts, which will take place on November 17.
"Karlov University takes an active part in the festival".
Participating choirs include choir of pedagogical and pedagogical Sciences; Vaclav Gample, rector, will be included in the committee," said Yakub Chalun, the head of an organizing committee.
The culmination will be a free public concert of the school choir, which will take place at 2 o'clock in the day on November 17 on the square in front of the National Technical Library in Daevice.
The work "Jazz Messa", the work of the famous Czech jazzman, Karel Ruzhchik, is also included in the program.
In the evening, in the official National House in Vinograds there will be a concert "Students in velvet", with the participation of choirs of universities, including choirs of Charles University.
The purpose of Festa Academica is to celebrate an International Student's Day and celebrate the 22 th Anniversary of the Velvet Revolution; as well as to present choral music of the highest quality to the public and to develop creative interaction among young people.
The main organiser - českých pěveckých sborů (Czech choirs) in cooperation with Johann Kepler secondary school.
The whole event takes place with the assistance of Bohuslav Svoboda, The Lord Mayor of Prague and Vaclav Gample, Rector of Charles University.
The festival will be held from November 16 to November 20 in Prague and Pardubitza.
The program offers both official concerts and numerous musical encounters, student chimpering sessions, daily performances, and so-and-e.
For additional information, please refer to the website of the festival: www.festacademica.cz
The Ambassador to the EU Vitsenov:
Chekov has a revolt of ill-wreggers and skeptics in relation to the euro.
Lissabon Treaty caused significant disagreements between individual organizations.
"I didn't expect there to be such a brutal war."
" It will take five or six years, before the situation somehow stabilizes, will calm down and all the players get used to their new roles", EU Ambassador Milena Vitsenoa began her lecture at the Faculty of Law.
It has proved, as far as her motto “Clear and open about Europe” in the first part of her lecture, where she described individual EU institutions and the relationship between them so simply and is understandable that many Lecturers would envy KU law.
Moreover, Vitzenova praised the work of the new Permanent President of the European Council, Herman Van Rompie:
At the outskirts, critics said he was an ordinary gray office mouse that couldn’t play any role; I had to say everyone was amazed at how well he coped with his role.”
“He is a person who can listen to twenty-seven participating countries at the same time, to communicate with them and who has a clear idea of what direction it is necessary to develop the EU.”
She explained her new position of representative on international relations and security as an answer to the question: “Who is the European Union? On what number do I need to call?”; that is, an important step towards unification and greater transparency of the Union’s policy towards countries such as China or India.
No one is going to forbade our ceremonies
Vitzenova further focused on the program, key for the EU in the past, the present and in the near future.
She called it a successful Czech presidence in the year before last.
The Czeches were dealing with the looming financial crisis; they overcame the crisis and organized the Eastern Partnership summit.
She said that the resignation of the government at the same time was a negative phenomenon that caused considerable damage to the Czech Republic.
At the moment, representatives of the Czech Republic in the EU are very busy.
According to the ambassador and the Pres Pres presiding, and the subsequent financial crisis have caused ongoing fervement.
In addition, it is Necessary to adopt a new seven-Year-Year budget of the EU, which is very difficult, given the current crisis.
Will the budget be meagre and economical, what areas will favor; which countries will receive more support and what are less; all these issues are in the upcoming program.
The Ambassador recalled the key slogans, which she brought to Brussels: "About Europe, in clear language."
“I don’t really like cuts, foreign words and jargon, which no one understands.
As citizens can understand that in Brussels people do not try to sell crook or round cranberries, bananas of different sizes, or that someone is going to ban our varieties of cheese.
It also intends to more effectively use the environment of the EU and to attract more Czechs to European organizations.
Dilapidated Europe - Our Future
The Ambassador argues that the Chekhovs are considered euro skeptics; as well as people celebrating more negative rather than the positive side of things.
She wants more representatives of the Czech Republic to be involved in European organizations.
She believes that several factors are to blame for this: for example, the humiliation of our candidates and their insufficiency to write motivated letters; at the same time with a small support from the Czech side.
In addition to the successful presidency of the Czech Republic, she noted the power and cooperation of the Vishegrade group.
“Believe you believe that when I meet someone from Poland and of Hungary, a Slovak joins us, a Frenchman next to me says: ‘Well, what kind of congregation, the Vishe Graphans group again?’ and he’s not a little happy about it.”
In the future, Vitsenov expects mainly new strict rules for the budget policy of the member states.
Compared with the New European Federation, it considers the idea of a two-speed, if not multi-sliding Europe more realistic.
“We have countries both inside and outside the eurozone.”
“We have a Schengen zone, and we already have an institute of enhanced co-operation.”
“For the first time, it has been said that the countries that want should come together, while those who don’t want could stay aside.”
"The number of such institutions will grow; it will be a truly two-speed Europe," Vitsenova awaits.
In this regard, it emphasized the role of both the Czech Republic and Herman Van Rompeii in promoting a rule according to which all issues related to the entire European Union should be discussed by all participating countries, and not only those in the eurozone.
The history of the brand :
Innovator of IBM enters the second century of its expiration.
If someone wants to find the word IMB's best-pronounces, it'll probably be "dolphthogue".
For the general public, IBM is a symbol of a technological revolution; the company is considered very up-to-date, although it was founded more than a hundred years ago.
The helmindenness of the company was laid by its first boss, dreamer Thomas J. Watson Sulphr.
He believed his motivity, according to which many of the world's problems can be easily solved, if people want to think.
His motto "Think!" thus became a stamp, around which unfolded the life of the future giant (as well as the name of his inner magazine, which IMB began to publish in 1935).
Moreover, this was the basis of the corporate culture that Watson carefully educated.
“For us at IBM, long-lived thinking means a constant movement towards the future.
IBM has survived and thrive for a hundred years, because it remained loyal to its primal values, although she was not afraid to change everything around itself.
During our first hundred years, this allowed us to transform the technology, business and the company.
For the second hundred years, we hope to achieve even more, ”says Samuel J. Palmizano, the current company’s chief of its jubilee.
Difficult system
In the 1930's, Watson approached the issue of caring for employees in the same way as Batya in the Czech Republic - IMB employees were one of the first American collaborators with a paid vacation, insurance against an employer, an elegant uniform and a complex system of bonuses for the best inventors and Entrepreneurs.
IBM’s long-differed relationship with consumers is equally advanced.
From the very beginning, the company found a brilliance application of talented people. It was one of the world's first companies that eliminated all the discrimination, which gave her an excellent choice.
It is consistent with an anti-discrimination strategy and the current plan, according to which a woman, Virginia Rometti, will replace Palmizano next year.
She has worked at IBM for thirty years; she is currently the director of sales, marketing and development.
Over the last few years, IBM has organized meetings, an online brainstorming, during which many future innovators arise.
Unsurprisingly, there are a lot of ideas - the company employs about half a million people.
Ensaging with a Good Reputation
Severe position of the company in the business is provided with a strong internal and external image.
“From the outset, from the point of view of IBM’s concept has been an organization rather than a technology company,” an Economist, a professor at the Harvard Business School and the author about IBM Rosabeth Moss Kanter said.
"IBM isn't a technology company, it's a company that's helping to solve business problems using technology," adds Jodge Colonie of Forrester Research.
As they say in the company itself, there is a difference between entering the market and creating it.
For a Hundundred Years, IBM or "Blue Giant", as it is called in the United States due to its logo, has become one of the largest companies in the world.
It seems that this is the most versatile technology company - developing hardware and software; infrastructure; hosting and consulting services - from servers to nanotechnologies.
She owns the largest number of patents among all U.S. technology companies, five of its employees received the Nobel Prize.
Its inconsumptions includes, for example, an ATM, a bank card, a financial swap, a barcode and a floppy disk.
With $ 220 billion, according to the market capitalization, IBM this year became the second-largest-largest technology company (the first place from Apple), overcoming Microsoft for the first time since 1996.
Look forward
Not all its products fell to the liking of customers and fit into the era. For example, IBM failed with its operating system OS/2; the online service of Prodigy and IBM PCjr computers.
“If your business is determined by moving forward, you don’t be emotionally attached to the tidings of the past,” says Samuel J. Palmisano.
That’s why IBM easily lays the foundations on a few platforms – if they don’t work, it gives it away.
This distinguishes, for example, from its competitor Microsoft, which is based and experiencing a fall on Windows, its own operating system.
Prompt technology
IBM receives basic revenues from services, about one-and-a-a-half come from computer programs and hardware.
While in the year, with capital half as much capital, it was the strongest manufacturer of the equipment.
Since the year 2000, IBM has sold low-yielding assets worth $15 billion. At the Same time, it has invested $58 billion in the purchase of promising technologies.
It continued to invest even after 2008, when the current economic crisis hit the world for the first time.
“IBIS envisages the example of its first director, Thomas J. Watson, who has enlarged investments during the Greater Deplor.
So far, it seems that IBM has not harmed the current Crisis.
Since the beginning of 2008, the share price of IBM has risen by a record 120 per cent; the company's net earnings have grown steadily.
The corporate mottto of IBM is to change everything except its own values.
Therefore, we can expect that even if another crisis erupts, this flexible giant will cope with the situation.
The history of IBM: from a cheese knife to spaceflight.
IBM (International Business Machines) was founded in New York a hundred years ago. Its original name "Colleation, Tabulation, Writing Corporation" was quite complex.
Initially, this was the brand, which was used for company branches in Canada and South America.
The basis of the future IBM was laid by a merger of the four companies, whose history begins in the 1880's.
They possessed technologies, such as the legendary "steel watch", that is, the clock fixing the time when the employees come and leave their jobs.
The architect of the new company was a businessman Charlez Ranlet Flint, who until 1930 he also headed the board of trustees of the company.
Flint recruited the director of a rival company, Thomas J. Watson, to help him manage the company.
Subsequently, the manager pushed the IBM founder into the shadows - Watson's ideas remain the basis of the unshakable corporate culture and individuality.
Watson headed the company until 1952.
IBM, as the name implies, began with the production and sale of various business equipment - from cheese knives and meat cuts to cash registers.
For the first four years of Watson’s leadership, revenue has doubled to nine million dollars, and a large-large expansion of the company to all continents has begun.
Watson became so important for the company that after almost for forty years his place in the chair of the director was taken by his son, Thomas Watson Jr.
under his leadership, IBM began to develop artificial intelligence technologies and created the first programming language.
In the 1960’s, both employees and IBM’s computers helped NASA control spaceflies on Mercury, Saturn, and in 1969 a human flight to the moon.
Meanwhile, in 1964, IBM developed the first family of computers - the IBM line System/360.
The classic PC, which defined computer standards of that time, called IBM 5150, appeared on the market in 1981.
Twenty years later, IBM has smuggled the production of computers to the Chinese Lenovo, while simultaneously buying the consulting department of PricewaterhouseCoopers, thus continuiping fully continuing on highly value-added services.
For the last three years, IBM has made great st's streak with its Smarter Planet concept.
Its aim is to use the prudent use of technologies in areas in which this has not yet been planned, and to improve the road situation and urban management.
In terms of commerce, IBM recently unveiled Smarter Commerce platform, which helps businessmen to control the entire trading cycle.
The traditions of IBM are strong even in our country.
In former Czechoslovakia, as the first country, located simultaneously in central and eastern Europe, IBM founded its branch in 1932.
Today, the IBM CZ also manages the Brno Strategic Outssourcing Center.
The headquarters of the central and eastern Europe is located in Praga, which also operates a world-class research group engaged in speech-recognition.
Rikhtarzhova about her unfaithful husband:
Ibeta, keep a fool, I don't need it anymore!
Darina Rikhtarzhova (53) said that it's all over!
After her husband, Josef Rekhtarge (53) became the bodyguard and lover of Iveta Bartoshova (45), Darina was still hoping that he would wake up and come back.
Nevertheless, she no longer wants to wait, and outlined clear rules for her future life.
Pepa can return home, but no longer as my partner," Rikhtarzhova explained.
When Darina Rikhtarzhova provided Bartoshova’s carrot in her house in the summer, she probably did not have the slightest idea of what will happen to her marriage.
And although she forced Iveta to leave Rzhean 30 days later, Pepa didn't leave the singer.
Moreover, he publicly admitted that he loves her.
After a certain time, Darina gave up, pretending that she reconciled with the romance of her husband; and now finally said goodbye to him.
He doesn’t care who his wife sleeps with.
Even if Rykhtarge and Bartoshova ever break up, his wife won’t accept him with open arms.
“He is the biological father of my sons, and if he desires to spend his last days in our house, no one will expel him.”
“However, it will end his days not as my beloved, lost and found old fool, but a person with whom he connects me with something,” Rikhtarzhova said, adding that she has already freed herself from her Husband and insists only on reciprocated decendants.
While Josef has nothing against the fact that his wife rejected him.
"I respect my wife's decision."
"I'm going with Iveta, I'm not going to change that."
"My wife decided to leave the marriage on paper, and I respect this decision."
"Our union is still functioning; I am responsible for the repair, garden, home and shopping."
“Darina and I communicate completely normally, but we don’t share the bed anymore,” Richtarge told Blesk magazine.
He argues that if Rikhtarzhov finds a new love, he won’t bother her.
“We don’t sleep together and I don’t care where she’s going, who she’s having a buddy.
I know it’s my fault, I fell in love with Iveta, and I’m taking full responsibility,” Joseph concluded.
