Pazlik doesn't consider his connection to Pilsen's club a burden, although he argues that the FAČR president must be independent.
Peleta is associated with Jablonets, and Reichl with the Praisan Dukla.
"It's not an ideal option."
“And yet I don’t see the point in the hypocritical transfer of my Pilsen shares to someone else, since I’m going to go back there in six months,” Pazlick says.
Peleta promised the new FAČR rules, which will allow you to avoid an Elective Pat
