"I'd also try to stop all incidents, starting with Bohemians' case or the aftermath of last year's corrupt scandal."
Immediately thereafter, I’d focus in talks with both the private and public sectors to guarantee a lot of money for the whole of football,” a forti-season-year-old candidate told ČTK two months ago.
Then he promised that his election to the position of the football head will not entail the dismissals of the staff.
