In accordance with SPIEGEL ONLINE, an international working group is currently investigating the accusations contained in Foodwatch.
The investigation should be completed by the end of the year, when the results will be presented to the Board of Managing Directors of Deutsche Bank - with recommendations for action.
The head of the bank then plans to annognate the changes following the investigation at the end of January.
Commodity trading can be reduced or completely stopped.
