NCUA is battivating to compensate for losses resulting from Billions.
It's the first agreement of this kind.
The registrar also drew attention to other major banks and in the summer opened a case against JPMorgan Chase, the Royal Bank of Scotland and Goldman Sachs.
Doctary Mortgage bonds are the so-called securities secured by a pool of mortgage loans.
They are backed up by domestic loans.
This solved the fate of a number of financial companies, when in 2007 a bubble in the real estate in the U.S.
American investment bank Lehman Brothers ordered to live for a long time in September 2008 on the crest of the financial crisis.
A few years a year later, U.S. javes are still fighting a storm.
Investors and regulators put forward a large number of claims, demanding to pay compensation or to punish scammers.
Behind the largest wave of claims is the Federal Agency for the Financing of Housing (FHFA).
