And this was noted during her first appearance in a swimsuit on Hilton beach and for her two screenings at an evening coronation.
Although she looked confident in both, it was noticeable that she lacked the strength and energy that representatives of Magdalene and Atlantic demonstrated.
Ariel Osorio, a journalist for "How at Home" on RCN, said the fact that Milena was called a princess "indicates that the candidate, who wins more awards during the competition, does not become the queen."
In addition, the representative of Valle recently avoided communicating with the press and it was wrong.
Another hypothesty is the fact that the representative of Valle failed an attempt to convince the jury of her interest in the social work, which is ultimately the essence of the National Contest of Beauty.
That’s why, two days prior to the choice, international jury member Lucy Doughty said that they were looking for a woman who is committed to the social needs of their country.
“Beauty alone isn’t good enough for Miss Columnia, we need to look not only at the appearance, but also focus on the public consciousness before they take part in the competition, they must already be involved in the projects,” she said.
There is also an assumption that the representative of Valle sinned with defects in the buttock and fibrosis, which was visible on her abdomen, but this is controversial, since the jury especially noted her as a candidate with “natural beauty”, taking into account her healthier body, good nutrition and responsible physical work.
Crown Consultant Jorge Hernán Orosko notes that Melina didn’t have the best body, which was better, “but fibrobes on her abdominal problems that didn’t really bleak for me, caused her to lose glasses on the last day.”
In the meantime, journalist Guido Ooyos of Cromos magazine believes that the mistake of the representative of Valles de Kauk was that she was subjected to a surgical intervention.
“Operations are good, but the spokeswoman Valle doesn’t know how to do it.
Her body hasn't been her advantage, and here she's punished.
As for the prize, which for the first time was presented by the organizers of the National Beauty Condition, a cruel prediction came true last night, it is said that it was a bailiff whom Raymundo presented to Melena as compensation for the fact that she lost the pleasure of obtaining the crown.
So it is or not, the fact is that today Melina begins a year of reign, not as a queen, but as a princess, the position that gives her the opportunity to represent Colombia at one of the international competitions, indicated directly by the organizers of the National Contest.
However, it will go down in history as one of the queens, who, despite her excellent performance at the competition in Kartagena, faced difficulties in obtaining the crown.
Such was the work of a man who identified Alfonso Kano’s body.
Kali crancer has made a story as a man who confirmed the death of Alfonso Canaugh.
